<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Authorized Keyword Search</title>
</head>

<body>

<center>

    <h1>Authorized Keyword Search Over Outsourced Encrypted Data</h1>

    <hr>

    <p>
        Secure keyword searching over encrypted data stored in the cloud.
    </p>

    <br>

    <h3>Project Modules</h3>

    <table border="1" cellpadding="10">

        <tr>
            <th>Module</th>
            <th>Description</th>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Data Owner</td>
            <td>Uploads and stores encrypted data.</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Data User</td>
            <td>Searches authorized encrypted data.</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Attribute Authority</td>
            <td>Manages user attributes and access rights.</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Verification Authority</td>
            <td>Verifies the user's search access rights.</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Cloud Server</td>
            <td>Stores encrypted data and performs keyword search.</td>
        </tr>

    </table>

    <br><br>

    <a href="login.jsp">
        <button>Login</button>
    </a>

    <br><br>

    <h3>Project Technologies</h3>

    <p>
        Java | JSP | JDBC | MySQL | AES | CP-ABE
    </p>

</center>

</body>
</html>